+| GREEN, after fix | same Qt 5 build, then `QT_QPA_PLATFORM=offscreen ./build/qt5-rowtableview/RowTableViewTest` (log `004-qt5-green-compile-run-with-moc.log`) | build **0**, run **0** (6 passed, 0 failed) |
+| CMake target | `cmake --build build --target RowTableViewTest` (logs `003`, `008`) | **0** |
